{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:09:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_7bb4a4e40af647bf8b556245b8cd7ab2","id":"pg_b588c996a8325681b295cce02367a651","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/maxktz-hitch-docs-stateful-context-idea-md-bcbfca260225-cce02367a651.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_118cdd2d89e15f94aac65beb7fb6b37a"],"title":"maxktz/hitch/docs/stateful-context-idea.md @ bcbfca260225","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:09:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7bb4a4e40af647bf8b556245b8cd7ab2"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_0ba161c12660d344be2c3507f0fdfb5068a0c68ced87cce3310cd76e0ff56d3e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The skill instructs agents to prefer `hitch context` first, avoid --all by default, use --wait instead of sleep polling, and only use hitch for collaboration rather than short tool calls."},{"claim_ids":["clm_2b50d452eefc34b43471e6de22d31a722a804fe8e38b6eeb3fdda4c1b6459d56"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"`hitch send-keys -t <terminal>` sends input to a terminal, supports keys like Enter, Tab, C-c, and options including --wait finish/quiet/time/output, --timeout (default 30s), --tail, and --force."},{"claim_ids":["clm_2bf1f55bf4047ff84256f81224f2612b07336f861e47aaf8fd03feebf89ffe86"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A SKILL.md (version 3) describes when agents should use hitch, e.g. before starting a dev server, watcher, tunnel, REPL, build, or log tail that may already be running."},{"claim_ids":["clm_52783d4ddb5d9029927b667fcfe7cef5edec8bd8404c7e2aacde3e259f84430a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"`hitch capture` mirrors tmux capture-pane behavior with tmux-compatible options (-p, -S, -E, -e) and accepts no-op compatibility flags such as -C, -J, -N, -T, -a, -q."},{"claim_ids":["clm_6dc0f5014bf85f06a57fd01d44d3497ffac6a9cbf647cb8cbf2e9c6c278947af"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The `hitch context` command shows compact terminal state and recent output, with forms for all project terminals, a specific terminal, or `--all` including terminals outside the project."},{"claim_ids":["clm_cb46d937cfce6256437e956c6d4eb4e6b5f2af0137f98e5a865edb6ddfc6b331"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Hitch refuses by default sending shell commands into terminals with running processes, printing terminal context instead; `--force` overrides this, and a sequence starting with C-c is allowed."}],"claim_ids":["clm_0ba161c12660d344be2c3507f0fdfb5068a0c68ced87cce3310cd76e0ff56d3e","clm_2b50d452eefc34b43471e6de22d31a722a804fe8e38b6eeb3fdda4c1b6459d56","clm_2bf1f55bf4047ff84256f81224f2612b07336f861e47aaf8fd03feebf89ffe86","clm_52783d4ddb5d9029927b667fcfe7cef5edec8bd8404c7e2aacde3e259f84430a","clm_6dc0f5014bf85f06a57fd01d44d3497ffac6a9cbf647cb8cbf2e9c6c278947af","clm_cb46d937cfce6256437e956c6d4eb4e6b5f2af0137f98e5a865edb6ddfc6b331"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:09:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_7bb4a4e40af647bf8b556245b8cd7ab2","id":"pg_effe83cd54de55f78e196f6341f8d6da","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/maxktz-hitch-skill-md-bcbfca260225-6f6341f8d6da.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_549d3fc0112e5f72992f5f86e5f05550"],"title":"maxktz/hitch/SKILL.md @ bcbfca260225","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:09:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7bb4a4e40af647bf8b556245b8cd7ab2"}
